    <edge source="&quot;SEPTEMBER 13, 2019&quot;" target="&quot;SEPTEMBER 20, 2019&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Preorders began on September 13, 2019, and the phone was officially released on September 20, 2019, one day after the official public release of iOS 13."</data>
